<title>JAPAN: Nikon - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nikon - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		151.80		vs	  116.15</p>
<p> Operating	   13.85		vs	   10.02</p>
<p> Current	     10.54		vs	    5.09</p>
<p> Net		    5.80		vs	    2.84</p>
<p> EPS		   15.67 yen	  vs	    7.67 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    370 million	  vs	 370 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nikon Corp is a major camera and semiconductor-related equipment manufacturer.</p>
